{"kind":"assert","text":"Three rulings.\nA. PB-3 session supplier (17081c44): approved. The supplier returns the session with its invalidation signal, or a typed refusal from the recorded vocabulary; the watch closes the reader on invalidation and schedules expiry from the claims. Fix the two recorded faults you found only where PB-3 needs them, and report the rest as findings: Reads.forget leaves an open stream unnotified, and Reads.session collapses a missing membership and other refusals to null.\nB. H2 unpriced producers (7354ea2c): approved as proposed. H1 admission stays unchanged. H2 publishes a checked reservation only when every selected-form producer is bounded; an unbounded producer yields an explicit unavailable quote, never zero and never scope-full; H4 establishes the missing bound before it enables a form. H2 adds no admission rule and no validated byte terms for legacy capacity. Record both producer limits and this rule in the H2 note amendment as open points for H4, and name the refusal a caller sees.\nC. Recorded client readback (fc65bfa5): thank you; the request MT-1 follows.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}